<title>JAPAN: Toyo Shutter to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Toyo Shutter to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyo Shutter Co Ltd said on Friday it had decided to buy back up to 500,000 shares at a cost not exceeding 400 million yen.  </p>
<p>The firm said earlier that it was considering changing its company regulations in order to speed up the process of repurchasing up to three million of its shares.</p>
</text>
